      "source_description": "TC-FLT-002: Continuous Day-1 to Day-2 incremental ingestion cycle -- Day-1 seed load of 10 customers, Day-2 drop of 3 attribute updates plus 2 brand-new customers into the same Auto Loader landing path across two separate triggered pipeline updates, verifying the SCD1 target seamlessly upserts existing rows and inserts new ones (final row count = day1_count + new_count, not day1+day2, since updates overwrite in SCD1).",
